            "review_title": "Review at My Way Cafe",
            "review_text": "cherrell p\n49 contributions\n0\nGreat Hot Rock Cooking\nSep 2019\nI love eating steaks and chicken cooked on a hot rock and My Way Cafe in the French Quarter is the only place in town where I have found this. Lvoe the whole dish - the meat, the choice of sauces (I like pepper), the fries, the bread roll, the salad. All comes together. Price is reasoanble. For an Aussie steak hot rock meal it's around $13. I love the outlook over the lake and watching the sun set and eat here 2 to 3 times a week.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 12, 2019",
